\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b1/7ccuee3rrb5qzlgf37ga9wh3q4xc8cq.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E8%AA%93%E7%BA%A6%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%A3%E5%89%91.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b1/7ccuee3rrb5qzlgf37ga9wh3q4xc8cq.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />誓约的圣剑\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦造成的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物理伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"\">物理伤害</font></span></span>]视为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">魔法伤害</span>]；拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]时免疫打断。<br />✦自身部分技能拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"圣剑术\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">圣剑术</font></span></span>]效果。<br />✦下述情况时可获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"圣剑共鸣\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">圣剑共鸣</font></span></span>]：行动结束时，每拥有生命值<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>的物理[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">护盾值</font></span></span>]，可获得1层。<br />每当获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]时，可获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层。<br />✦以[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"连招蓄势\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">连招蓄势</font></span></span>]触发攻击时，物攻提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>。<br />✦以[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"圣剑术\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">圣剑术</font></span></span>]技能攻击前，对目标额外施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼魔防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼魔防2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼速度2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼速度2</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%B5%9B%E7%90%B3%E5%A8%9C\" title=\"角色图鉴库/赛琳娜\"><img alt=\"头像 赛琳娜.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4a/222z807mx8ohc0jnz6ynwe3updwx5im.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">赛琳娜</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwik